PAPI 6 removed the high-level counter API (PAPI_start_counters,
PAPI_accum_counters, PAPI_num_counters) and changed PAPI_perror.  Use a
per-thread event set with PAPI_accum, and PAPI_num_cmp_hwctrs(0).

